+/* ZPASS pixel count measured by the live engine [GT6 0056] (rsx_live_draw.c, "ZPASS pixel count"): it registers
+ * these two when it can run occlusion queries. report: NV4097_GET_REPORT of type 1 - 1 = taken, the engine writes the
+ * count through gcm_zpass_report_store, at once or when the GPU has it; 0 = not measured, the walker answers as it
+ * always did. clear: NV4097_CLEAR_REPORT_VALUE. */
